# Route Parameters

URL:

```
/api/movies/title/The Matrix
```

Endpoint:

```js
app.get("/api/movies/title/:title", (req,res)=>{

});
```

Kiolvasás:

```js
req.params.title
```

↓

```
The Matrix
```

---

# URL Decode

```js
decodeURIComponent(req.params.title)
```

Példa:

```
The%20Matrix
```

↓

```
The Matrix
```

---

# Query Parameters

URL:

```
/movies?page=2
```

Kiolvasás:

```js
req.query.page
```

↓

```
2
```

